1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,500
This is Chapter & Co. — a fully responsive
eCommerce bookstore built for the IBM AI Specialist Capstone.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:13,000
The application was designed and implemented from scratch
using IBM Bob as the Agentic IDE.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Stack: Next.js 15 · React · TypeScript · PostgreSQL · Tailwind CSS

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Everything began with a single master prompt inside IBM Bob.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,500
Bob proposed the architecture, data model
and a seven-phase incremental delivery plan.

6
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:42,000
Bob generated: Prisma schema · Auth.js authentication
Zustand cart store · REST API handlers

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Server-side checkout enforces authoritative pricing —
the server always recalculates from the database,
ignoring any client-submitted values.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 01:03,500
The homepage renders as a React Server Component:
hero banner · featured books · categories · bestsellers

9
01:03,500 --> 00:01:13,000
Catalogue: full-text search · category filtering
· price range · five sort modes — all server-side.

10
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Book detail: cover · author · categories
· delivery estimate · related books · Add to Cart

11
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Cart persists in localStorage via Zustand —
survives page refreshes without requiring login.

12
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Checkout: delivery address selection · demo payment
(clearly labelled — no real card data stored)

13
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:51,500
Gift points: 500 welcome points seeded for demo account
100 points = £1 discount

14
00:01:51,500 --> 00:02:05,000
Order placement uses a Prisma transaction:
confirm pricing · deduct stock · record payment · award points

15
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:13,000
30 unit tests · all passing
Vitest: cart store · utilities · Zod validation schemas

16
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:22,000
48-hour cancellation window enforced server-side
Stock restored · gift points refunded on cancel

17
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Developer review: fixed 4 TypeScript strict-mode errors
· corrected Prisma query typing
· updated Next.js v15 config API

18
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:44,000
Git branch: feature/chapter-and-co-bookstore
Prisma migrations · OpenAPI spec · architecture docs

19
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:54,000
IBM Bob accelerated: architecture · schema · components
· API handlers · tests — all from structured prompts,
reviewed and refined by the developer.

20
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:00,000
The result: a production-ready bookstore demonstrating
Agentic AI development in practice.
